 "notes": "Kai's face from the owner's reference photo (docs/CHARACTER_LOOK.md, \"Kai's face (from the owner's photo)\"). Shape: the MakeHuman head fitted to the photo's MediaPipe landmarks and face outline at the photo's own camera and pose (likeness/fit.py), then corrected in likeness:final against the photo's landmark ratios (brows lower, the brow-ridge shelf removed, fuller and wider lips, mouth a little higher, a shorter, rounder, less projecting nose). Look (kai_look.npz from likeness/look_data.py): his measured skin, colour zones, the two moles on his left cheek and the faint spots, his thick straight brows, the full short beard and moustache (filled inside its outline, moustache dense), dark brown eyes. Hair A (faces_candidates/kai_photo/ and the installed faces/kai.json): his long curls pulled back and tied (photo_tied), a few grey strands. Hair B (this file): the same curls worn loose at messy medium length (faces_candidates/kai_photo + kai_photo_loose merged). Fix round 1: the AR monocle parked on the temple (cast_nrzero.py), brows 2.5 mm lower, straighter, with feathered heads, a top edge of fine hairs and tapered tails (browShape); lids opened, a darker iris, a mauve-grey under-eye; a dense moustache hanging over the top of the upper lip (moHang) on a denser painted mat, the lighter warm hair under the lower lip, finer flat beard cards; matte mauve-brown lips with a soft border and lip lines; skin 6 % darker, a matte nose tip, a softer in-game scatter tint (skinScatter); a longer chin, fuller cheeks, a rounder jaw, a broader nose bridge; softer moles. Fix round 2: the full beard runs as one band down the face outline from the sideburns at eye level to the jaw (the outline as the photo's camera saw it, a diagonal cheek line in profile, the sideburn band 0-45 mm ahead of the ear up to 34 mm), longer jaw-side cards standing off the skin and a lower, rounder chin rim; a denser, softer moustache hanging over the top of the upper lip (moHang 0.22, 0.35 at the